  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First release.\n\n      - One local MCP endpoint per XrmToolBox process; one plugin tab per connection, where every call is approved and logged.\n      - Discovery tools: connections, publishers, solutions and their components, tables, relationships, choices, ribbons, FetchXML queries, component state and required components.\n      - Solution shaping: create solutions, add and remove components with required components and subcomponents always off, and gated publisher creation.\n      - First-run setup wizard, with setup prompts for the agent and an export of the agent-companion skills.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "XrmToolBox plugin that gives a local coding agent person-approved Dataverse operations over MCP",
  "title": "D365 Agent Companion MCP for XrmToolBox",
